### ============================================
### BASIC USER FLOW - Simple Testing
### ============================================
### Follow these steps in order for basic testing

### STEP 1: Setup - Create User
### 1.1: Create or get user
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User 76",
  "email": "testuser76@example.com"
}
### Copy "id" from response → paste in @user_id above

### STEP 2: Browse Movies
### 2.1: Browse all movies
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies

### 2.2: Get movie details (pick any movie from step 2.1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies/{{movie_id}}
### Copy "id" from response → paste in @movie_id above

### STEP 3: Select Showtime
### 3.1: Get showtimes for selected movie
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies/{{movie_id}}/showtimes
### Copy a showtime "id" from response → paste in @showtime_id above

### STEP 4: Check Seats & Book
### 4.1: Get available seats for showtime
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}/seats
### Copy seat "id" values that show "is_available: true" → paste in @seat_id1, @seat_id2 above

### 4.2: Create booking (locks seats, status: pending)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}", "{{seat_id2}}"]
}
### Copy "id" from response → paste in @booking_id above

### STEP 5: View Booking Details
### 5.1: View booking details (receipt format)
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}

### STEP 6: Payment & Confirmation
### 6.1: Process payment (automatically confirms booking and releases locks)
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_id": "{{booking_id}}",
  "payment_method": "Khalti",
  "amount": 56
}
### Note: 
### - Payment automatically confirms booking and releases Redis locks
### - Response includes receipt with ticket number
### - Copy "payment_id" from response → paste in @payment_id above
### - Duplicate payments are prevented by booking_id check (can't pay same booking twice)

### 6.2: Verify booking is confirmed
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: status = "confirmed"

### 6.3: Get payment details (includes receipt if successful)
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/booking/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: Payment details with receipt (ticket number, customer info, etc.)

### 6.4: Get payment by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/{{payment_id}}
### Expected: Full payment record

### STEP 7: View Bookings
### 7.1: Get all bookings for user
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/user/{{user_id}}

### 7.2: Get all bookings (admin view)
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings

### STEP 8: Cancel Booking (Optional)
### Note: Must cancel at least 2 hours before showtime
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Change of plans"
}

### 8.1: Verify cancellation
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: status = "cancelled"

### 8.2: Verify seats are freed
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}/seats
### Expected: Previously booked seats now show "is_available: true"

### 8.3: Check refund status
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/refund?booking_id={{booking_id}}
### Expected: refunded: true (if payment was successful before cancellation)

