### ============================================
### REDIS LOCKING TEST - Concurrent Booking
### ============================================
### Test that Redis locks prevent double-booking

### TEST 1: Concurrent Booking - Same Seats
### Run these TWO requests at the SAME TIME (within 1-2 seconds)
### Expected: One succeeds (201), one fails (409)

### Request 1: User 1
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}"]
}

### Request 2: User 2 (run immediately after Request 1)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}"]
}

### Expected: One gets 201 Created, other gets 409 Conflict

### TEST 2: Lock Release After Confirmation
### Step 1: Create booking
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}"]
}

### Step 2: Process payment (automatically confirms booking and releases locks)
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_id": "{{booking_id}}",
  "payment_method": "eSewa",
  "amount": 29.98
}

### Step 3: Try to book same seat (should fail - already booked)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}"]
}

### Expected: Step 3 returns 409 "Seat X is already booked"

### TEST 3: Lock Release After Cancellation
### Step 1: Create booking
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}"]
}

### Step 2: Cancel booking (releases locks and seats)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Testing"
}

### Step 3: Try to book same seat (should work - seat freed)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id2}}"]
}

### Expected: Step 3 returns 201 Created (seat available again)

